==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 12~22 seconds<sup>360f~660f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]] and meatshields such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] can definitely make this level easier. If you have [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]], this level is very easy. With enough support to knockback the Doge Darks, a good stack of Pirate Cats can completely take Dark Emperor Nyandam out of the game, constantly knocking him back when he's about to strike.

